  "narrative": {
    "text": "Table of the three progressive-disclosure levels, four columns: Level, File, Context Window, # Tokens. Level 1 is SKILL.md metadata (YAML), always loaded, about 100 tokens. Level 2 is the SKILL.md body (Markdown), loaded when the Skill triggers, under 5k tokens. Level 3 and beyond is bundled files — text files, scripts, data — loaded as needed by Claude, marked unlimited with an asterisk. The table is an IMAGE, so none of these figures appear in the page's text layer.",
